THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

SmartRemind uses the following third-party services for advertising
and purchase functionality:

  • RevenueCat (https://www.revenuecat.com/)
    Subscription and purchase management.

  • Google Play Billing
    Payment processing. Subject to Google's terms of service.

  • Google AdMob (https://admob.google.com/)
    Advertising SDK. Subject to Google's terms of service.
    Shown to users who have not purchased a Supporter tier.

  • Google User Messaging Platform
    Advertising consent and privacy choices where applicable.

  • ThreeTenABP and AndroidX libraries
    Local date/time, scheduling and interface functionality.
    Third-party components remain subject to their respective licenses.

All other components of the Software remain subject to this proprietary
license.

